&lt;p&gt;GILGIT: PPP’s Attaullah Shah and Istehkam-i-Pakistan Party’s (IPP) Imam Malik are again vying for the GBA-16 (Diamer-II) seat in Gilgit as repolling is under way at three stations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A total of 2,780 registered voters are eligible to cast their votes.&lt;/p&gt;
